{"id":"zeremonie","lemma":"Zeremonie","pos":"noun","rank":3235,"glosses":["ceremony"],"ipa":"/tseʁemoˈniː/","audio":"https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/transcoded/0/03/De-Zeremonie.ogg/De-Zeremonie.ogg.mp3","gender":"f","forms":{"genitive":"Zeremonie","plural":"Zeremonien"},"examples":[{"text":"Er liebt Zeremonien.","en":"He loves ceremonies.","words":[{"g":"he / it"},{"g":"to love","l":"lieben"},null]},{"text":"Die Zeremonie war eindrucksvoll.","en":"The ceremony was impressive.","words":[{"g":"the"},null,{"g":"was","l":"sein"},{"g":"impressive"}]},{"text":"Es war eine sehr traditionelle Zeremonie.","en":"It was a very traditional ceremony.","words":[{"g":"it"},{"g":"was","l":"sein"},{"g":"a"},{"g":"very"},{"g":"traditional","l":"traditionell"},null]},{"text":"Die Zeremonie fand am Nachmittag statt.","en":"The ceremony took place in the afternoon.","words":[{"g":"the"},null,{"g":"to find","l":"finden"},{"g":"at the / on the"},{"g":"afternoon"},{"g":"instead of"}]},{"text":"Sie haben die ganze Zeremonie gefilmt.","en":"They filmed the entire ceremony.","words":[{"g":"she / they / you"},{"g":"have"},{"g":"the"},{"g":"entire","l":"ganz"},null,{"g":"to film, to shoot","l":"filmen"}]}]}